# With a 300-byte frame text limit a 700-byte record goes out as two ETB frames and one ETX frame.
option max_frame_text 300
record 
submit
expect write ENQ
expect timer 15
peer ACK
expect frame 1 block 
expect timer 15
peer ACK
expect frame 2 block 
expect timer 15
peer ACK
expect frame 3 final RRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRR<CR>
expect timer 15
peer ACK
expect stop_timer
expect write EOT
expect sent
